    "raw_text": "\nmulti-dimensional analysis:\nLet me analyze this video based on the provided frames and the text prompt.\n\nThe text prompt asks for: \"生成一段15秒、9:16竖屏的二维手绘动画职场双人短片，采用二维手绘动画风格\" (Generate a 15-second, 9:16 vertical format, two-person workplace short animation in 2D hand-drawn style).\n\nLooking at the frames:\n\nVisual Quality Analysis:\n- The visuals are solid with clear rendering of characters and environment; overall quality is good but not flawless.\n- The art style remains consistent as a clean 2D hand-drawn aesthetic.\n- Lighting from the window is well integrated and contributes to atmosphere.\n- Character designs are well-rendered with natural proportions and expressions.\n- The scene composition is coherent and visually appealing.\n- There are no major artifacts or distortions; minor refinements could push it toward perfection.\n- Overall Visual Quality aligns with a score of 4.\n\nText-to-Video Alignment Analysis:\n- The video adheres closely to the prompt: two people in professional attire seated at a table with a book, in an indoor workspace, rendered in 2D hand-drawn style.\n- The framing and pacing match the requested vertical 9:16 format and 15-second duration; no extraneous content is present.\n- The alignment is effectively perfect, supporting a score of 5.\n\nPhysical Consistency Analysis:\n- The scene generally follows plausible physics and spatial relationships; interactions feel believable.\n- However, there are subtle inconsistencies in hand positioning and object contact that prevent a flawless depiction of physical realism.\n- These minor issues keep the overall physical consistency at a moderate level, corresponding to a score of 3.\n\nOverall assessment:\n- The video demonstrates strong technical execution and faithful prompt adherence. Visual quality is solid (4), text-to-video alignment is excellent (5), and physical/common-sense consistency is moderate (3).\n</think>\n\n(1) visual quality: 4\n(2) text-to-video alignment: 5\n(3) physical/common-sense consistency: 3\n"
